                                                "sense_id": "0bcd7640-8443-35b2-b1b3-cda0dcbe3003",
                                                "text": "Yes: I think he is a good fellow: rather miscellaneous and bric-à-brac, but likable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81a21f45-e608-4369-a83e-4879137b7db9",
                                                "sense_id": "0bcd7640-8443-35b2-b1b3-cda0dcbe3003",
                                                "text": "Haven't an affair in the world, […] except a quarrel with a bric-à-brac man."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "495bc891-6091-47e6-9d12-36e41f714855",
                                                "sense_id": "0bcd7640-8443-35b2-b1b3-cda0dcbe3003",
                                                "text": "The papier mâché desk he passed tolerantly as bric-à-brac, but the china-cabinet was dismissed with contempt."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ffb7d209-c669-402c-bc77-af6dff22ced0",
